1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:02,610
(Sheldon:)Captain Kirk won.

2
00:00:03,450 --> 00:00:05,980
(Penny:)Kirk cheated.

3
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:09,090
(Sheldon:)Impressive that you know that.

4
00:00:09,990 --> 00:00:11,220
(Sheldon:)It's hard to believe

5
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:13,020
(Sheldon:)I'm actually having
this conversation with you.

6
00:00:13,030 --> 00:00:14,830
(Penny:)Right there with you.

7
00:00:16,030 --> 00:00:21,870
(Sheldon:)Kirk beat the Kobayashi Maru
by reprogramming the simulator.

8
00:00:21,870 --> 00:00:23,970
(Sheldon:)That's it.
What?

9
00:00:23,970 --> 00:00:26,370
(Sheldon:)I'll reprogram Howard.
What...?

10
00:00:26,370 --> 00:00:29,310
(Penny:)Sheldon, you can't
reprogram people.

11
00:00:29,310 --> 00:00:32,280
No, you can't reprogram people.

12
00:00:33,210 --> 00:00:35,780
(Sheldon:)To James Tiberius Kirk.

13
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:47,460
(Sheldon:)Hello, all.

14
00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:49,660
(Leonard:)- Hello.
- Hey.

15
00:00:49,660 --> 00:00:52,560
(Sheldon:)Howard, you're feeling better
about me today, aren't you?

16
00:00:52,570 --> 00:00:54,030
(Howard:)Not really.

17
00:00:54,030 --> 00:00:55,900
(Sheldon:)Yes, you are.

18
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:58,470
(Sheldon:)I'm using
neurolinguistic programming

19
00:00:58,470 --> 00:01:00,840
(Sheldon:)to modify your thought patterns.

